# What's new notes

If this change is something a seller can see on the website or in the Chrome
helper, add or update an item in `src/content/whats-new.ts` in the **same
commit**. Follow `.agents/skills/whats-new/SKILL.md`.

- One page: `/whats-new`. Mark helper work with `helper: true`.
- Screenshots live in `public/whats-new/` and open in the in-page lightbox.
  Do not link a raw image URL.
- Skip tests-only, telemetry, and generated `extension-live/` / `.next/`.
